# edit: the few lines a person still types. Enter, a new value, Esc: saved, and the gutter marks
# the line. That edit undone after a trip to another file and redone: each file keeps its own
# history (#163). Alt+Backspace deletes the word before the cursor (#120). Shift+Down selects
# two lines and Tab indents them (#3, #176), Ctrl+Z takes it back; Alt+Shift+Right grows a
# selection by words (#4) and Ctrl+C puts it on the clipboard through OSC 52. Ctrl+F while
# editing finds and stays in edit mode (#56). Ctrl+N makes a file. A secret typed into the
# ignored .env is saved there and copied nowhere under HOME. The pane closed (SIGHUP) under
# typing not yet saved: merl saves it and exits 0 (#80). Under tmux's default `set-clipboard
# external`, which drops OSC 52, Ctrl+C still puts the line in a tmux buffer (#395).
merl app/config.py
wait class Settings:
key t /
type 50
key Enter Enter Delete Delete
type 100
wait app/config.py ●  10:25  [edit]
key Escape
wait 10▎    page_size: int = 100
run grep -q 'page_size: int = 100' app/config.py
key o
type models.py
key Enter
wait app/models.py  1:1
key /
type CANCELLED =
key Enter End Enter Enter
type DISPUTED = "disputed"
key Escape
wait app/models.py  12:
key o
type config.py
key Enter
wait app/config.py  1:1
key C-z
wait page_size: int = 50
key C-y
wait page_size: int = 100
# the default DSN points at compose's db service: localhost deleted by word, db typed
key /
type /orders")
key Enter Enter M-BSpace
type db
key Escape
wait "postgresql://orders@db/orders"
key :
type 17
key Enter Enter S-Down S-Down Tab
wait             api_token=os.environ["API_TOKEN"],
key C-z Escape
wait 17         api_token=
key :
type 17
key Enter Enter M-S-Right M-S-Right C-c
wait copied
run $SMOKE_TMUX show-buffer | grep -q 'api_token='
key C-f
type refund_window
key Enter
wait app/config.py  11:5  [edit]
key Escape C-n
wait new: app/
type money.py
key Enter
type from decimal import Decimal
key Escape
wait app/money.py  1:28  [code]
run grep -q 'from decimal import Decimal' app/money.py
key o
type .env
key Enter
wait .env  1:1
key C-End Enter Enter
type STRIPE_KEY=sk_live_smoke_4242
key Escape
wait .env  3:30  [code]
key o
type README
key Enter
wait README.md  1:1
key C-End Enter Enter
type Runbook: docs/notes.md
wait README.md ●
run kill -HUP $($SMOKE_TMUX display -p -t 0 '#{pane_pid}')
wait merl exited: 0
run grep -q 'Runbook: docs/notes.md' README.md && grep -q sk_live_smoke_4242 .env && ! grep -rq sk_live_smoke "$HOME"
merl app/money.py
wait app/money.py  1:1
run $SMOKE_TMUX set -s set-clipboard external
key C-c
wait copied 1 line
run $SMOKE_TMUX show-buffer | grep -q 'from decimal import Decimal'
